{"ID":"20240206113320-y7kvz2x","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206113320-y7kvz2x","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113320-y7kvz2x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113330-sldu6e2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113324-bztebd8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113330-sldu6e2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:116,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:116\u0026#125;","title":"月季花","type":"doc","updated":"20240902084249"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206113330-sldu6e2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113330-sldu6e2","updated":"20240206113333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于湖北、江苏、河北、山东等地区。\n【性状】\t花蕾类球形，直径1.5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.5cm。花托长圆形；萼片5，暗绿色先端尾尖；花瓣复瓦状排列，有的散落，长圆形，紫红色或淡紫红色；雄蕊多数，黄色。体轻，质脆。气清香，味淡、微苦。\n【性味】\t甘，温。\n【功效】\t活血调经。用于月经不调、痛经。"}]},{"ID":"20240206113324-bztebd8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113324-bztebd8","updated":"20240206113324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206113324-vi4rsjs.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240714112000-3wp5uyo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714112000-3wp5uyo","updated":"20240714120932"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 474px;","style":"width: 464px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"月季花 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/月季花 11-20240714112059-jpw86oa.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 464px;\" parent-style=\"width: 474px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 288px;","style":"width: 278px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"月季花 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/月季花 10-20240714112000-t2tvr0l.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 278px;\" parent-style=\"width: 288px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 474px;","style":"width: 464px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"玫瑰花 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/玫瑰花 5-20240714114055-na9gwz5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 464px;\" parent-style=\"width: 474px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240714111444-4ziegrs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240714111444-4ziegrs","updated":"20240714111445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 778px;","style":"width: 768px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"月季花 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/月季花 4-20240714111445-wiau3r4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 768px;\" parent-style=\"width: 778px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 392px;","style":"width: 382px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBrac